+Notably, the certificate authority features ACME for automatic certificate
+rotation.
+
+<!-- ohpc_begin -->
+<!-- ohpc_comment Creating OpenCHAMI certificates -->
+```bash
+openchami-certificate-update update ${sms_name}
+```
+<!-- ohpc_end -->
diff --git a/docs/install/templates/provisioner/openchami/client-install.md.j2 b/docs/install/templates/provisioner/openchami/client-install.md.j2
new file mode 100644
